n you do bad things, is the source of the demon king's magical power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Karma, you can do anything you want. ......!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/575fbfb0185624dc85cbca34c27b460b.webp?t=1764898332\" width=300 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/3c50432811f516e2284a6fe1d4b2966c.avif?t=1764898332\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras_big/3c50432811f516e2284a6fe1d4b2966c.avif?t=1764898332 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a demon king, interacting with your subordinates is an important part of your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go out for a drink or have a conversation with them to increase their loyalty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529780/extras/79375bbac032c01e5dd32ee2ee195721.avif?t=1764898332\" width=620 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an raising dating sim for those who want to be a bad and strong woman and train a female-attacking demon king army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, put it on your wish list now and take the first step toward world domination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The very domination! Be the demon king who conquers the world! &quot;MURAYAKI VILLAIN&quot;a village-burning, female-oriented, ♀ &gt; ♂ Demon King Army raising dating sim", "supported_languages": "Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_